
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Biodata Siswa</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74ebd5, #9face6);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .container {
            background: white;
            width: 400px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #4b4b9b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .garis {
            width: 100px;
            height: 4px;
            background: #74b9ff;
            margin: auto;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .biodata p {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .biodata span {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 110px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4b4b9b;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 25px;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>BIODATA SISWA</h1>

        <div class="garis"></div>

        <div class="biodata">
            <p><span>Nama</span> : Dewi</p>
            <p><span>Alamat</span> : Lampung</p>
            <p><span>Kelas</span> : X RPL</p>
            <p><span>Hobi</span> : Membaca dan Menulis</p>
            <p><span>Cita-cita</span> : Programmer</p>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>✨ Terus Belajar dan Raih Impianmu! ✨</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
